{"seq":1,"slug":"tanstack-query-deep","title":"TanStack Query 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/libraries/tanstack-query-deep","wordCount":1010,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"tanstack-query-深度实践\">TanStack Query 深度实践</h1><p>TanStack Query v5 是 2026 年前端数据请求领域功能最完整的库。它不仅仅是一个&quot;请求发送器&quot;——它是一个完整的异步状态管理器，将服务端状态视为独立于客户端状态的一等公民。本文深入其核心机制与生产级实践模式，面向已读过基础篇并准备在真实项目中深度使用的开发者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>QueryClient 三层架构</strong>：QueryClient（全局单例）→ QueryCache（存储所有查询状态）→ Query 实例（维护订阅者列表），实现精确的细粒度通知</li>\n<li><strong>queryOptions 工厂模式</strong>：将 queryKey 与 queryFn 绑定为类型安全的配置对象，消除 key-fn 不匹配的 bug 并支持集中管理</li>\n<li><strong>useSuspenseQuery 一等支持</strong>：在类型层面保证 <code>data</code> 不为 <code>undefined</code>，配合 React Suspense 实现声明式加载</li>\n<li><strong>结构化共享（Structural Sharing）</strong>：深比较新旧数据只替换变化的引用，配合 <code>select</code> 实现最小化重渲染</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心架构与数据流\">核心架构与数据流</h2><p>TanStack Query 的架构由三个核心对象组成：QueryClient 是全局单例，管理所有缓存；QueryCache 存储所有查询状态；每个 Query 实例维护自己的订阅者列表。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 组件层&#10;        A[useQuery Hook]&#10;        B[useQuery Hook]&#10;        C[useMutation Hook]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph QueryClient&#10;        D[QueryCache]&#10;        E[MutationCache]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Query实例&#10;        F[Query: [&#39;users&#39;, 1]&quot;]&#10;        G[Query: [&#39;posts&#39;]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    A --&gt; F&#10;    B --&gt; G&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    F --&gt; D&#10;    G --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt;|通知订阅者| A&#10;    D --&gt;|通知订阅者| B\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 组件层\n        A[useQuery Hook]\n        B[useQuery Hook]\n        C[useMutation Hook]\n    end\n\n    subgraph QueryClient\n        D[QueryCache]\n        E[MutationCache]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Query实例\n        F[Query: ['users', 1]\"]\n        G[Query: ['posts']\"]\n    end\n\n    A --&gt; F\n    B --&gt; G\n    C --&gt; E\n    F --&gt; D\n    G --&gt; D\n    D --&gt;|通知订阅者| A\n    D --&gt;|通知订阅者| B</pre><p>v5 统一了 API 签名为单一对象形式，消除了 v4 中多重载带来的类型推断问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// v5 唯一调用方式&#10;const { data, isPending, error } = useQuery({&#10;  queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;, userId],&#10;  queryFn: ({ queryKey, signal }) =&gt; fetchUser(queryKey[1], { signal }),&#10;  staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000,&#10;  gcTime: 10 * 60 * 1000,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// v5 唯一调用方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isPending</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, userId],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">queryKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queryKey[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], { signal }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  staleTime: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gcTime: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"query-options-工厂模式\">Query Options 工厂模式</h2><p>大型应用中，查询配置散布在各组件是维护噩梦。v5 引入 <code>queryOptions</code> 辅助函数，将查询定义集中管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { queryOptions } from &#39;@tanstack/react-query&#39;;&#10;&#10;// queries/users.ts —— 查询工厂&#10;export const userQueries = {&#10;  all: () =&gt;&#10;    queryOptions({&#10;      queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;],&#10;      queryFn: fetchAllUsers,&#10;    }),&#10;&#10;  detail: (id: string) =&gt;&#10;    queryOptions({&#10;      queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;, id],&#10;      queryFn: () =&gt; fetchUser(id),&#10;      staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000,&#10;    }),&#10;&#10;  posts: (id: string) =&gt;&#10;    queryOptions({&#10;      queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;, id, &#39;posts&#39;],&#10;      queryFn: () =&gt; fetchUserPosts(id),&#10;    }),&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 使用时&#10;const { data } = useQuery(userQueries.detail(userId));&#10;&#10;// 失效时——类型安全的 queryKey&#10;queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: userQueries.all().queryKey });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { queryOptions } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@tanstack/react-query'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// queries/users.ts —— 查询工厂</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userQueries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    queryOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      queryFn: fetchAllUsers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  detail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    queryOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      staleTime: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  posts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    queryOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'posts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUserPosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">detail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 失效时——类型安全的 queryKey</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invalidateQueries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ queryKey: userQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().queryKey });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种模式的核心优势是 queryKey 与 queryFn 的绑定——再也不会出现 key 与实际请求不匹配的 bug。同时，queryOptions 返回的类型信息让 <code>setQueryData</code> 和 <code>getQueryData</code> 也获得完整的类型推断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"suspense-模式与-usesuspensequery\">Suspense 模式与 useSuspenseQuery</h2><p>v5 引入专用的 <code>useSuspenseQuery</code>（替代 v4 中不安全的 <code>suspense: true</code> 选项），在类型层面保证 <code>data</code> 不为 <code>undefined</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// useSuspenseQuery 的返回类型中 data 不含 undefined&#10;const { data } = useSuspenseQuery({&#10;  queryKey: [&#39;user&#39;, userId],&#10;  queryFn: () =&gt; fetchUser(userId),&#10;})&#10;// data 类型是 User，不是 User | undefined&#10;&#10;// 配合 React Suspense boundary&#10;&lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ProfileSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;  &lt;UserProfile userId={userId} /&gt;&#10;&lt;/Suspense&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// useSuspenseQuery 的返回类型中 data 不含 undefined</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSuspenseQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, userId],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// data 类型是 User，不是 User | undefined</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 配合 React Suspense boundary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;ProfileSkeleton />}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">UserProfile userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{userId} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hook</th>\n<th>data 类型</th>\n<th>需要 Suspense boundary</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>useQuery</code></td>\n<td><code>T | undefined</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需要手动处理加载状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>useSuspenseQuery</code></td>\n<td><code>T</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>声明式加载，类型更简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>useSuspenseInfiniteQuery</code></td>\n<td><code>InfiniteData&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Suspense + 无限列表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"并行查询与依赖查询\">并行查询与依赖查询</h2><p>多个独立查询天然并行执行，无需额外配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 自动并行——React 在同一渲染周期内触发所有 hook&#10;const { data: user } = useQuery(userQueries.detail(userId));&#10;const { data: settings } = useQuery(settingsQueries.current());&#10;const { data: notifications } = useQuery(notificationQueries.unread());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动并行——React 在同一渲染周期内触发所有 hook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"